/v1/","context":{"app_id":3240610,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1847286114030027","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"update","title":"Localization Update and Patch Notes: 0.12.0","summary":"Hello Dreamers, Absolute insanity. Never in our wildest dreams did we think we’d reach 15,000 wishlists for Memoria Wake. We’ve been putting our heads down this year in an effort to push the demo build for Next Fest into as good of shape as it currently is and it’s been such a joy seeing so many people pick up the demo and enjoy all of our hard work.No time to waste though! In Patch 0.12.0 — which is the version everyone should already be playing on — we’ve added the following: LocalizationAdded","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T19:02:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030027","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:01:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1846018067928651","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: 0.11.12","summary":"Patch Notes: 0.11.12This build version is now available for existing Playtesters, as well as public demo (public demo gets 1st)Hello Dreamers!0.11.11 is the first patch (of many) leading up to Steam Next Fest.Playtesters: We've addressed many of your issues raised. Thank you so so much.Bugfixes:Fixed the controller binding not working issue.Fixed softlock bug in Deadline's arena after you defeat it.Fixed a bug where holding Watergun and attacking might result in a softlock.Polish:Added a lot of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:34:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928651","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1846018067926669","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Demo Live! Play Now!","summary":"Watch The Trailer For Our Next Fest Demo!Then Play The New Demo! ============================================Hey Dreamers, Coming straight off our playtest, we’re dropping our Fall Steam Next Fest Demo early so everyone has plenty of time to play Memoria Wake as well as all the other amazing demos going live during this Next Fest. All throughout the playtest we squashed bugs and implemented feedback from playtesters. And while we are going to continue taking feedback and adding polish, we’re hap","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:02:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926669","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1845383656379701","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes: 0.11.10","summary":"Patch Notes: 0.11.10Hello Dreamers!We will be posting regular patch notes from now on:Bugfixes:Fixed a breaking bug where the first bench in University Ruins (Grand Hall) was set to some other checkpoint menu.Fixed a bug where fast travel did not save the new checkpoint as the respawn point.Fixed a bug with combat rooms and dropping rewards, which can sometimes occur if you die at the sametime as the last enemy (die and complete the combat room at the same time.Fixed UI pivot bugs with non-16x9 ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T04:04:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379701","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1844751498227711","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"announcement","title":"Memoria Wake Playtest Now Live! Join Now!","summary":"Today, Memoria Wake is opening up for a beta playtest, and YOU are invited.This has been a long time coming and all of us here at Team Crescendo are nervously excited to get everyone into the playtest. Starting today, we can finally invite you to step inside and see what this dream really looks like for yourself!Playtest PeriodSeptember 25 (Today) – October 3, 7 days in total.Limited time only! Join now if you want to help shape what Memoria Wake looks like in the future! How to Join1. Head to o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T17:41:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227711","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1840310314338085","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"announcement","title":"Coming to Gamescom 2026","summary":"This august, the team is bringing Memoria Wake to Gamescom 2026 in Cologne, Germany as a part of @IndieArenaBooth! This is our first time going, and we can't wait to showcase our game to a massive international audience. Who else is going to be there? If you have any recommendations for what we absolutely need to see (or eat!) while in Cologne, drop them in the replies!As always, connect with us byJoining our Discord to chat with the devs and join our (growing) community!Subscribe to our Youtube","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T02:52:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1833968530898043","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"announcement","title":"Memoria Wake is coming 2027 to PC and Xbox","summary":"The wait is almost over, Dreamers.We are incredibly excited to announce that Memoria Wake will be featured in this year's MIX Summer Showcase! During the event, we will be debuting our official Xbox Console Reveal Trailer, giving you a brand-new look at the brutal combat and surreal world we've been crafting.The MIX's website is here:https://t.co/69k3OLMvn1Our trailer: Side note, the game will release in early 2027! We don't have a fixed date yet but we are doing everything we can to deliver thi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T16:05:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530898043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1827626365756871","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"announcement","title":"Memoria Wake is coming to PAX EAST 2026!","summary":"Hey everyone!Memoria Wake is Coming to PAX!Our team is bringing Memoria Wake to PAX EAST in Boston from March 26 - 29! We are bringing you new chapter previews, new enemies, new bosses, and more... Hope to see you there!!Public Steam Demo Update A new patch (0.8.0) is rolling out for the public demo on March 26! This update is dedicated entirely to aesthetic polish and bug fixes for a smoother core experience (no new content changes).Update your game and let us know what you think in our Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T09:10:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365756871","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3240610-1824644522846309","game_id":"steam-3240610","kind":"announcement","title":"Better Late Than Never: Introducing Memoria Wake","summary":"Hi Dreamers!We realized that while we launched our Steam page and Demo last year, we were so heads-down in development that we never actually made a proper announcement to celebrate it! So, consider this the official welcome!This is our debut game Memoria Wake, an isometric souls-like action-adventure set in a fragmented dreamscape. Read the whole description here!We have created a souls-like adventure game unlike any other.Memoria Wake's story will take you on Nilo's journey, as he sets to conq","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-16T20:18:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522846309","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3240610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3240610":"2026-10-26T00:23:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3240610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"3738600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:23:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3240610","app_id":3240610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"100cf88102551b918087d44be208518b4d2db522c27750aaa1b074a536c61037","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"악몽 같은 괴물과 과거의 기묘한 파편들로 가득한 초현실 세계를 헤쳐 나가며, 사라진 친구를 찾아 나서세요… 이 소울라이크 액션 어드벤처에서 적절한 순간에 회피하고, 패링하고, 공격하세요.","publishers":